        "text_caw47F": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A statement hospitality and wedding venue located at Dallas Burston Polo Club, Leamington Spa.</p><p>Simran Design Ltd was appointed to deliver a full interior design scheme across the venue’s key guest-facing spaces, including the entrance, reception, bar and hospitality areas, and bridal suite. The brief required a refined yet commercially durable environment capable of supporting high-volume events and premium celebrations throughout the year.</p><p>From concept development and 3D visualisation through to detailed sourcing and specification, the design was developed by us and executed by the client’s contractor team, with ongoing remote design support to maintain alignment with the approved scheme.</p>",
